ontent=thumbnail_unscaled", "original_url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/02/Plan_du_port_de_Mocha_au_Yemen_en_1737.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original", "source_url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Plan_du_port_de_Mocha_au_Yemen_en_1737.jpg", "credit": "Anonymous Unknown author", "credit_line": "BNF", "license": "Public domain", "license_url": "", "attribution_required": "false", "restrictions": "", "date_created": "1737", "width": 1257, "height": 899, "licensing_verified": false, "sha256": "e6fde906045e7bfc968046bb9a305169b5d9bde53dc7e746ac056f1c376725d4"}}, {"kind": "story", "title": "\u0643\u0644 \u0628\u0644\u062f \u0644\u0647 \u0628\u0635\u0645\u062a\u0647", "body": "\u0643\u0644 \u062f\u0648\u0644\u0629 \u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629 \u0637\u0648\u0631\u062a \u0637\u0631\u064a\u0642\u062a\u0647\u0627 \u0641\u064a \u0627\u0644\u062a\u062d\u0645\u064a\u0635 \u0648\u0627\u0644\u062a\u062d\u0636\u064a\u0631\u060c \u0648\u0627\u0644\u0647\u064a\u0644 \u0647\u0648 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0648\u0627\u0628\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0643\u062b\u0631 \u0627\u0633\u062a\u062e\u062f\u0627\u0645 \u0644\u0625\u0636\u0627\u0641\u0629 \u0646\u0643\u0647\u0629 \u0645\u0645\u064a\u0632\u0629 \u0644\u0644\u0642\u0647\u0648\u0629.", "punch": "", "claim_ids": ["c2"], "image_query": "cardamom spice", "image": {"provider": "commons", "asset_id": "151971310", "title": "File:Green Cardamom Pods.jpg", "description": "Whole, dried green cardamom pods from Tamil Nadu, India in a bowl.", "download_url": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/82/Green_Cardamom_Pods.jpg/1920px-Green_Cardamom_Pods.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail", "original_url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/82/Green_Cardamom_Pods.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original", "source_url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Green_Cardamom_Pods.jpg", "credit": "Misterneedlemouse", "credit_line": "Own work", "license": "CC0", "license_url": "http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en", "attribution_required": "false", "restrictions": "", "date_created": "2024-08-28 17:17:10", "width": 1600, "height": 1600, "licensing_verified": false, "sha256": "e7c9c45e97fca33aa9796ab5ce4bcfb73b48cf83c131d00bc86fb4b352d69d31"}}, {"kind": "story", "title": "\u062a\u0631\u0627\u062b \u0639\u0627\u0644\u0645\u064a \u0645\u0633\u062c\u0644 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u064a\u0648\u0646\u0633\u0643\u0648", "body": "\u0627\u0644\u0642\u0647\u0648\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629 \u0645\u0633\u062c\u0644\u0629 \u0643\u062a\u0631\u0627\u062b \u062b\u0642\u0627\u0641\u064a \u063a\u064a\u0631 \u0645\u0644\u0645\u0648\u0633\u060c \u0648\u062a\u0642\u062f\u064a\u0645\u0647\u0627 \u0645\u0631\u062a\u0628\u0637 \u0628\u062c\u0644\u0633\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0627\u0626\u0644\u0629 \u0648\u0627\u0633\u062a\u0642\u0628\u0627\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0636\u064a\u0648\u0641 \u0628\u0643\u0644 \u0628\u064a\u062a.", "punch": "\u0639\u0627\u062f\u0629 \u062a\u062c\u0645\u0639 \u0627\u0644\u0628\u064a\u0648\u062a \u0645\u0646 \u0632\u0645\u0627\u0646", "claim_ids": ["c5", "c7"], "image_query": "finjan coffee cup", "image": {"provider": "commons", "asset_id": "57709080", "title": "File:Dessert-Cafe-Coffee-Food-Arabic-Morning-Delicious-988329.jpg", "description": "Arabic coffee and chocolate", "download_url": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/Dessert-Cafe-Coffee-Food-Arabic-Morning-Delicious-988329.jpg/1920px-Dessert-Cafe-Coffee-Food-Arabic-Morning-Delicious-988329.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail", "original_url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/46/Dessert-Cafe-Coffee-Food-Arabic-Morning-Delicious-988329.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original", "source_url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dessert-Cafe-Coffee-Food-Arabic-Morning-Delicious-988329.jpg", "credit": "1507844 from Pixabay", "credit_line": "https://pixabay.com/en/coffee-arabic-cafe-delicious-988329/ archive copy at the Wayback Machine", "license": "CC0", "license_url": "http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en", "attribution_required": "false", "restrictions": "", "date_created": "2013-12-25", "width": 1600, "height": 1066, "licensing_verified": false, "sha256": "d84bcdabdbb98a30c4770fcae4a894c6e5b7d0fbbd0073284e02c3b1fd62c5ed"}}], "sources": [{"id": "wiki-4506407", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/?curid=4506407", "text": "Arabic coffee, known in Arabic as qahwa (Arabic: \u0642\u0647\u0648\u0629), is a family of brewed coffee made from Coffea arabica beans. Most Arab\ncountries throughout the Middle East developed distinct methods for brewing and preparing coffee. Cardamom is an often-added spice, but it can also\nbe served plain or with sugar.\nArabic coffee is bitter and usually served without sugar. It is typically brewed in a dallah\nor cezve, and served in a small cup decorated with a pattern, known as a finj\u0101n. Culturally, Arabic coffee is served during\nfamily gatherings or when receiving guests, with its preparation reflecting local customs.\nArabic coffee originated in Greater Yemen, beginning in the port\ncity of Mokha in Yemen and eventually travelling to Mecca in Hejaz, Egypt, the Levant, and then, in the mid-16th century, to\nTurkey and from there to Europe where coffee eventually became popular as well. Arabic coffee is an Intangible Cultural Heritage of Arab", "retrieved_text_sha256": "2bdb4920583ae06fbd1794d0c5c37710c52cd0c02b8ae171215328d9b4681d0d"}], "research": {"event_date": null, "sensitive": false, "claims": [{"id": "c1", "fact": "\u0627\u0644\u0642\u0647\u0648\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629 \u062a\u064f\u0639\u0631\u0641 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629 \u0628\u0627\u0633\u0645 \u0642\u06